flowchart TD
    start([start]) --> classify_document
    classify_document -->|supported type| extract_obligations
    classify_document -->|unknown / error| finalize_report
    extract_obligations -->|quarantined, schema-validated facts| retrieve_rules
    retrieve_rules -->|catalogue requirements + regulation citations| compare
    compare --> draft_findings
    draft_findings --> human_review{{human_review - interrupt}}
    human_review -->|approve / correct / reject| finalize_report
    finalize_report --> done([end])
    classDef q fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b3261e;
    class classify_document,extract_obligations q;
